{"chunkId": "0cda43c3-5413-5c99-a576-1d4088a0cb31", "text": "练习测试：在不查看资料的情况下，主动尝试回忆已经学习过的内容，通过测试来强化记忆和理解。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "435113c1-e03a-599d-9f17-4259110ff741", "text": "练习测试的第 1 步：完成一次初步学习。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "966cb8c4-501e-5035-bbf9-6fcefc0c4a09", "text": "练习测试的第 2 步：关闭教材或笔记。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "81d238ad-ce14-570d-a95b-d57a3ab9ecd8", "text": "练习测试的第 3 步：尝试复述或写出主要内容。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "cfb1bd6d-6902-52f0-8bb2-1bfa7b98b984", "text": "练习测试的第 4 步：重新查看资料并检查遗漏。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "ed36f767-b526-5707-aa9f-bf9955040573", "text": "练习测试的第 5 步：重新学习遗漏部分。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 5, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "afcded3d-bb78-51b8-8138-9349b62e8cb5", "text": "练习测试适合已经完成初次学习，原因是：主动回忆需要学习者已经拥有可以提取的知识。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "已经完成初次学习"}}
{"chunkId": "33fd90e1-8cdf-5f9f-bfef-3570ef30dd87", "text": "练习测试适合需要加强长期记忆，原因是：主动提取可以加强知识保持，在延时测试中效果尤为突出。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要加强长期记忆"}}
{"chunkId": "bc75f18e-d503-5b17-807e-ee9f45877aa1", "text": "练习测试不适合完全没有接触过学习内容，原因是：应先进行首次学习并建立基本理解，再进行检索练习。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-practice-testing", "strategyName": "练习测试", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "完全没有接触过学习内容"}}
